        "approval_date": "2017-11-06",
        "description": {
          "text": "Expanded ALK-positive metastatic NSCLC indication to first-line by removing restriction to patients who progressed on or were intolerant to crizotinib; also converted accelerated approval to full approval",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval sNDA expands the approved indication for the treatment of patients with anaplastic lymphoma kinase (ALK)-positive, metastatic non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) as detected by an FDA-approved test by removing the restriction for use only in patients who have progressed on or are intolerant to crizotinib. This approval also fulfills PMR 2995-1 cited in the December 11, 2015 approval letter for NDA 208434.",
              "doc_id": "6c93ce20-7048-5bba-9048-2eb837baad63",
              "line": 6
